145
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:13,760
And we take a conservative approach and apply

146
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:17,120
the restrictions they come up with to all the data that we mediate, not just the

147
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:19,600
data that's originally coming from government sources.

148
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,020
There are now a

149
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:24,160
bit more than 150 species on the list.

150
00:18:24,740 --> 00:18:27,280
I think you can see some of the same taxonomic biases that we see in the

151
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,760
