Tanya's presentation will be a nice round-out to the talks today and focused on the

1165
01:18:04,834 --> 01:18:05,934
activities of the

1166
01:18:07,214 --> 01:18:10,414
restricted access species/sensitive

1167
01:18:10,514 --> 01:18:11,414
species

1168
01:18:12,534 --> 01:18:15,474
working group, and I will hand over to you.

1169
01:18:16,534 --> 01:18:17,094
Thank you.

