3233
03:34:23,990 --> 03:34:24,310
showed you,

3234
03:34:25,550 --> 03:34:29,370
the collector number that the collector has put onto the specimen,

3235
03:34:30,430 --> 03:34:33,930
and the date that they were working, and that means that we get adjacent localities

3236
03:34:33,970 --> 03:34:35,050
close by. So,

3237
03:34:36,250 --> 03:34:39,810
I've been working on a project with colleagues in Malaysia, so a lot of my

