3835
05:38:34,386 --> 05:38:35,486
in new published research.

3836
05:38:36,706 --> 05:38:40,566
It's functionally equivalent to the longstanding tradition in taxonomy

3837
05:38:40,586 --> 05:38:44,186
where authors of new taxa send their reprints, or now

3838
05:38:44,266 --> 05:38:47,986
PDFs, to the collectors as thanks for their early

3839
05:38:48,066 --> 05:38:49,126
efforts in the field.

3840
05:38:50,346 --> 05:38:54,226
And another service in Bionomia is for users to auto-archive versioned

3841
