3867
05:40:37,786 --> 05:40:41,646
The single greatest problem has been, and continues to be,

3868
05:40:41,946 --> 05:40:44,466
unstable identifiers for occurrences.

3869
05:40:45,246 --> 05:40:48,346
The source of this issue is a complex blend of what I call

3870
05:40:48,446 --> 05:40:51,866
