3871
05:40:51,926 --> 05:40:55,846
migration from one system to another with ill-planned or disregarded digital

3872
05:40:55,886 --> 05:40:58,086
continuity, among other kinds of problems.

3873
05:40:59,246 --> 05:41:03,146
Whole datasets are frequently deleted from the GBIF index and replaced

3874
05:41:03,206 --> 05:41:05,206
as nested records in other datasets.

3875
05:41:05,786 --> 05:41:09,366
Yet other datasets are sometimes split into thematic subsets and then

3876
05:41:09,426 --> 05:41:13,346
