3914
05:43:24,166 --> 05:43:28,086
Source data from very large organizations are frequently unstable

3915
05:43:28,126 --> 05:43:31,866
and incorrect, whereas third-party enhancements made on their

3916
05:43:31,926 --> 05:43:35,126
