3918
05:43:38,606 --> 05:43:42,346
As responsible stewards of natural history collections data, we must fully

3919
05:43:42,406 --> 05:43:46,206
populate identifiedBy or its equivalent in the emergent

3920
05:43:46,266 --> 05:43:49,546
