that discuss them and the taxa that they relate to.

4035
05:48:50,998 --> 05:48:54,778
Also, the data held in Wikidata is being reused by a multitude of

4036
05:48:54,938 --> 05:48:58,878
AI applications, and this reuse provides yet another avenue

4037
05:48:58,918 --> 05:49:02,638
of access, reuse, and visualization of type specimen data.

4038
05:49:06,078 --> 05:49:09,378
Now, Wikidata can aid the creation of responsible AI

4039
05:49:09,458 --> 05:49:13,338
applications. Wikidata tracks the data origins via the

4040
05:49:13,398 --> 05:49:15,358
references provided for each specimen.

4041
05:49:15,578 --> 05:49:19,158
Sorry, each statement, and Wikidata's also transparent as it

4042
