tracks all the edits being done to an item via either the

4043
05:49:23,158 --> 05:49:27,078
Wikidata account making those edits or if there is

4044
05:49:27,138 --> 05:49:30,918
no account, there's via the IP address being used by

4045
05:49:30,958 --> 05:49:34,718
those editors. So by providing type specimen data and

4046
05:49:34,778 --> 05:49:38,518
ensuring that it is modeled consistently and referenced

4047
05:49:38,598 --> 05:49:41,958
appropriately, Wikidata can actually help AI applications be

4048
05:49:42,018 --> 05:49:45,938
transparent about the provenance and source of the information those

4049
