06:05:01,588 --> 06:05:01,868
also

4302
06:05:02,908 --> 06:05:06,848
within the WikiWas for the Wikidata community, and to

4303
06:05:06,908 --> 06:05:10,868
provide information specifically for Wikidata editors.

4304
06:05:13,868 --> 06:05:17,608
So this is an example of a Wikidata item for the Harriman

4305
