4384
06:10:14,078 --> 06:10:17,978
and then use the minimum recommended properties as a starting

4385
06:10:18,058 --> 06:10:21,578
point and extend these descriptions where

4386
06:10:21,618 --> 06:10:22,198
appropriate.

