And yeah, record these Wikidata identifiers, the

4388
06:10:27,258 --> 06:10:30,178
QIDs in your collection management system.

4389
06:10:31,038 --> 06:10:34,938
Several systems have these options already to integrate those.

4390
06:10:35,498 --> 06:10:39,018
And these QIDs can then be connected to

4391
06:10:39,118 --> 06:10:40,958
