5815
07:52:11,296 --> 07:52:15,136
So instead of scheduling one of these services on each specimen

5816
07:52:15,236 --> 07:52:18,996
one at a time, what we can support now is running these over an

5817
07:52:19,036 --> 07:52:21,116
